---

<BaseLayout
  title={pageTitle}
  description={pageDescription}
  path={pagePath}
  schemas={schemas}
>
  <section class="preview-hero">
    <div class="container preview-hero-grid">
      <div class="preview-hero-copy">
        <p class="kicker"><Label text="_free_website_preview" /></p>
        <h1>We'll build a free website preview for your business.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Before you spend a dollar, see a clearer homepage direction built around your services, customers, and next best call to action.
        </p>
        <div class="preview-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-green btn-cta" href="#preview-questionnaire" data-ga-event="click_free_preview_hero_cta">Start My Free Preview</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#industry-preview-feed" data-ga-event="click_free_preview_examples">See Example Previews</a>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-strip" aria-label="Offer details">
          <span>Free custom website preview</span>
          <span>Delivered in 2-3 business days</span>
          <span>No obligation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-proof-grid" aria-label="What your free preview includes">
          <article>
            <strong>Built around your services</strong>
            <span>We use your answers to shape the homepage around what customers need to understand first.</span>
          </article>
          <article>
            <strong>Clearer lead path</strong>
            <span>Calls, quote requests, bookings, or consultations are treated as the main outcome.</span>
          </article>
          <article>
            <strong>Lightweight request</strong>
            <span>No payment, no long sales call, and no commitment to use the preview.</span>
          </article>
          <article>
            <strong>Relevant examples below</strong>
            <span>Browse 40 industries after the form to see the range of preview directions.</span>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero-form-card" id="preview-questionnaire" aria-label="Free website preview questionnaire">
        <div class="form-intro">
          <p class="kicker"><Label text="_questionnaire" /></p>
          <h2>Start with a few business details.</h2>
          <p>
            The more specific you are, the better the preview direction will be. Most previews are delivered within a few hours.
          </p>
          <div class="request-note">
            <strong>No payment required</strong>
            <span>Website Support Studio reviews your answers and prepares a custom preview before you decide what to do next.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="preview-support-note">
            <strong>Every preview is evaluated with SEO, AEO, GEO, and Website Operations Desk best practices in mind.</strong>
            <span>Every approved website includes Website Operations Desk support after launch.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form class="preview-form" data-endpoint={previewEndpoint} novalidate>
          <input type="text" name="company_website" class="hp-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />

          <div class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>

          <div class="field-pair">
            <label>
              <span>Name *</span>
              <input name="name" autocomplete="name" required />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Email *</span>
              <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required />
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="field-pair">
            <label>
              <span>Phone</span>
              <input name="phone" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Business name *</span>
              <input name="business_name" autocomplete="organization" required />
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="field-pair">
            <label>
              <span>Current website URL, optional</span>
              <input type="url" name="current_website_url" placeholder="https://example.com" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Business type / industry</span>
              <input name="industry" placeholder="Roofing, law firm, salon, consulting..." />
            </label>
          </div>

          <label>
            <span>What does your business do? *</span>
            <textarea name="business_description" rows="4" required placeholder="Tell us what you sell, who you help, and what customers usually ask for."></textarea>
          </label>

          <fieldset>
            <legend>What pages do you need?</legend>
            <div class="check-grid">
              {["Home", "About", "Services", "Contact", "Pricing", "Gallery", "Blog"].map((page) => (
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="pages_needed" value={page} /> <span>{page}</span></label>
              ))}
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <label>
            <span>What style do you like?</span>
            <input name="preferred_style" placeholder="Modern, simple, bold, luxury, friendly, local, professional..." />
          </label>

          <label>
            <span>Competitor or inspiration websites</span>
            <textarea name="inspiration_websites" rows="3" placeholder="Paste links or describe sites you like."></textarea>
          </label>

          <label>
            <span>Primary goal *</span>
            <select name="primary_goal" required>
              <option value="">Select a goal</option>
              <option value="get_leads">Get leads</option>
              <option value="book_appointments">Book appointments</option>
              <option value="sell_products">Sell products</option>
              <option value="look_more_professional">Look more professional</option>
              <option value="replace_old_website">Replace old website</option>
              <option value="other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <label>
            <span>Services/products to highlight</span>
            <textarea name="services_to_highlight" rows="3"></textarea>
          </label>

          <label>
            <span>Target customers</span>
            <textarea name="target_customers" rows="3" placeholder="Who should the website speak to?"></textarea>
          </label>

          <fieldset>
            <legend>Logo/brand colors available?</legend>
            <div class="radio-row">
              <label><input type="radio" name="logo_brand_colors_available" value="yes" /> <span>Yes</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="logo_brand_colors_available" value="no" /> <span>No</span></label>
            </div>
          </fieldset>

          <label>
            <span>Anything else we should know?</span>
            <textarea name="additional_notes" rows="4"></textarea>
          </label>

          <button class="btn btn-green btn-cta" type="submit" data-ga-event="submit_free_preview_request">Get My Free Website Preview</button>
          <p class="privacy-note">Submitting this form creates a structured preview request for Website Support Studio to review. No paid commitment is created by this form.</p>
        </form>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section industry-feed" id="industry-preview-feed">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head split">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker"><Label text="_examples_by_industry" /></p>
          <h2>Preview ideas for businesses like yours.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Browse example directions across common local and professional industries. Your preview is still custom to your business, but this gives you a quick sense of the range WSS can shape.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feed-filter-row" aria-label="Preview focus areas">
        {previewFocusAreas.map((category) => <span>{category}</span>)}
      </div>

      <div class="industry-feed-grid">
        {industryConcepts.map((concept) => (
          <article class="industry-feed-card">
            <div class="industry-feed-image">
              <img
                src={concept.image}
                sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 31vw, (min-width: 768px) 46vw, 92vw"
                alt={concept.businessType + " website preview concept"}
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                width="900"
                height="600"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="industry-feed-copy">
              <p>{concept.businessType}</p>
              <h3>{concept.title}</h3>
              <span>{concept.tag}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="industry-feed-outcome">{concept.outcome}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section preview-answer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="summary">
        <strong>Simple offer:</strong> Fill out the questionnaire, we review the details, and we prepare a free website preview for your business. It is a preview request, not a paid order or an instant automated build.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="kicker"><Label text="_how_it_works" /></p>
        <h2>A clear path from questionnaire to preview.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Tell us about your business.</h3>
          <p>Share your contact details, business type, current website if you have one, and what your business does.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>02</span>
